    "## 7. Visual check\n",
    "\n",
    "Counts and IoU tables narrow things down; they can't tell you whether a split was\n",
    "*correct*. Look at the masks."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 24,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
